<title>USA: Designs sees Q1 loss of $0.15-$0.20/shr.</title>
<headline>Designs sees Q1 loss of $0.15-$0.20/shr.</headline>
<dateline>NEEDHAM, Mass. 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Designs Inc, reporting a seven percent drop in March same-store sales, said Thursday it expects a loss of $0.15 to $0.20 a share for the first quarter ending May 3.</p>
</text>
